  "description": "Send your ride straight to cloud 9 with a cushy saddle, comfortable grips, and wide tires for the smoothest of sailing. Chatham boasts double-walled rims to protect the tubes in your tires from the spokes on your wheels. This bike also sports improved lightweight pedals and extremely durable with boron steel axles. Our version of the classic beach cruiser comes equipped with a built-in coaster brake for a controlled ride and responsive stopping. The hand-built step-thru steel frame is perfectly shock absorbent for comfortable and reliable riding, regardless of what gets in your way.\n\nChatham-1 is crazy straightforward to ride and maintain. When you need to stop, simply pedal backward to engage the coaster brake. This bike also sports improved pedals that are lightweight and extremely durable with boron steel axles.\n\n*Due to differences in screen resolutions, please note that colors may differ slightly.",
